### ============================================================
### CUSTOMER API
### ============================================================


### 1. CREATE CUSTOMER
### Content-Type: multipart/form-data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CustomerBoundary

------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="customer_name"

ABC Trading LLC
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_name"

ABC Trading Company
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="industry"

manufacturing
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="website"

https://www.abctrading.com
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cr_number"

CR123456
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="currency"

AED
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="vat_number"

VAT123456789
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="payment_term"

30_days
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cr_expiry_date"

2027-12-31
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="billing_address"

123 Business Street
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

Dubai
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="state"

Dubai
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="country"

UAE
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="postal"

00000
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phno"

+971501234567
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="admin_email"

admin@abctrading.com
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="financial_email"

finance@abctrading.com
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="technical_email"

technical@abctrading.com
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="client_status"

active
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="credit_limit"

50000.00
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="opening_balance"

10000.00
------CustomerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Important customer account
------CustomerBoundary--


### 2. CREATE CUSTOMER - MINIMUM DATA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "XYZ Customer3",
    "industry": "retail",
    "currency": "AED",
    "payment_term": "30_days",
    "client_status": "active",
    "credit_limit": "25000.00",
    "opening_balance": "0.00"
}


### 3. LIST ALL CUSTOMERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. LIST CUSTOMERS - SEARCH
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?search=XYZ
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. SEARCH BY CUSTOMER ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?search=CUS001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. SEARCH BY CUSTOMER NAME
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?search=Trading
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. FILTER ACTIVE CUSTOMERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?client_status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. FILTER INACTIVE CUSTOMERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?client_status=inactive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 9. LATEST CUSTOMERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?ordering=-created_at
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 10. OLDEST CUSTOMERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?ordering=created_at
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. SORT CUSTOMER NAME - ASCENDING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?ordering=customer_name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 12. SORT CUSTOMER NAME - DESCENDING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/?ordering=-customer_name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 13. GET CUSTOMER DETAIL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 14. UPDATE CUSTOMER - PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "ABC Trading Updated",
    "company_name": "ABC Trading Company Updated",
    "industry": "manufacturing",
    "website": "https://www.abctrading.com",
    "cr_number": "CR123456",
    "currency": "AED",
    "vat_number": "VAT123456789",
    "payment_term": "60_days",
    "cr_expiry_date": "2028-12-31",
    "billing_address": "Updated Business Address",
    "city": "Dubai",
    "state": "Dubai",
    "country": "UAE",
    "postal": "00000",
    "phno": "+971501234567",
    "admin_email": "admin@abctrading.com",
    "financial_email": "finance@abctrading.com",
    "technical_email": "technical@abctrading.com",
    "client_status": "active",
    "credit_limit": "75000.00",
    "opening_balance": "15000.00",
    "notes": "Updated customer information"
}


### 15. PARTIAL UPDATE CUSTOMER - PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "ABC Trading Updated",
    "credit_limit": "100000.00"
}


### 16. CHANGE CUSTOMER STATUS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_status": "inactive"
}


### 17. DELETE CUSTOMER
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 18. CUSTOMER SUMMARY
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/summary/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 19. SUMMARY - WITH ACTIVE FILTER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/customer/summary/?client_status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}